      "type": "text",
      "text": "PURPOSE AND REAL-WORLD USE\nPydantic v2 parses and validates data through `BaseModel`; `Field` adds constraints, `model_validate()` accepts Python data, and `model_validate_json()` accepts JSON. Treat `ValidationError` as an expected input failure and map it to a safe response. Type hints alone are not runtime validation, and Pydantic does not replace authorization or business rules.\n\n",
